  ('Alpine Check Shirt Red', 'Red and cream festival shirt', 'Traditional Shirts', 59.00, 79.00, ARRAY['https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598033129183-c4f50c736f10?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85'], 'A warm red check shirt made for festive evenings and relaxed weekends.', ARRAY['Soft brushed cotton', 'Reinforced collar', 'Pearl-style buttons'], 'Brushed cotton flannel', ARRAY['S','M','L','XL','XXL'], ARRAY['Red Cream'], 36, 8, false, true, true, 'NEW', 'FM-SH-002', ARRAY['Machine wash cold', 'Hang dry'], 'Long-wearing fabric chosen to keep its shape across seasons.', 'Red Alpine Check Shirt | Festa Munich', 'Red and cream Bavarian check shirt for festival dressing.'),
