  ('Midnight Trachten Shoe', 'Black suede shoe with cream stitching', 'Footwear', 139.00, 169.00, ARRAY['https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543163521-1bf539c55dd2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85'], 'A polished black option that works with embroidered lederhosen and formal looks.', ARRAY['Contrast cream stitching', 'Padded heel', 'Flexible rubber sole'], 'Nubuck leather', ARRAY['40','41','42','43','44','45','46'], ARRAY['Black'], 19, 4, false, true, true, 'NEW', 'FM-SH-005', ARRAY['Use nubuck brush', 'Keep away from direct heat'], 'Produced in small batches to avoid overproduction.', 'Midnight Trachten Shoe | Festa Munich', 'Black nubuck Bavarian shoe with contrast stitching.'),
